        <mxCell id="lg_text" value="PK primary key, FK foreign key, UQ unique, NN / not null, generated = derived from start_date.&amp;#xa;Crow's foot = many (0..*); bar = exactly one; circle and bar = zero or one (optional link).&amp;#xa;Composite keys (user_id, id) keep every id unique per user; composite foreign keys keep links within one user.&amp;#xa;Relationship labels read parent to child: 1 : 0..* means one parent has many children.&amp;#xa;Solid lines = foreign keys; dashed line = the user_id link to auth.users." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="1054" width="1220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
